                <span class="text-gray-300">Professional design</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-neutral-900/50 rounded-3xl p-8 border border-neutral-800">
            <div class="text-4xl mb-6">🎯</div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Ultra-Targeted Distribution</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6">Perfect timing, perfect audience. We reach nomads exactly when they're planning their next destination—in coworking spaces and colivings where they have time to dream about travel.</p>
