              <div class="flex items-center">
                <CheckIcon class="mr-3 h-5 w-5 text-yellow-400" />
                <span class="text-gray-300">Colivings & hostels (travel planning time)</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center">
                <CheckIcon class="mr-3 h-5 w-5 text-yellow-400" />
                <span class="text-gray-300">Italia Nomad Fest (captive audience)</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-neutral-900/50 rounded-3xl p-8 border border-neutral-800">
            <div class="text-4xl mb-6">📱</div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Conversion Tools Included</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6">Measurable conversion system with 90-day tracking. 3 QR codes + booking integration drive 15-25% of readers to take action within 30 days.</p>
            <div class="space-y-3">
              <div class="flex items-center">
                <CheckIcon class="mr-3 h-5 w-5 text-yellow-400" />
                <span class="text-gray-300">3 QR codes: tourism site (40% scans) + booking platform (35%) + contact form (25%)</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center">
                <CheckIcon class="mr-3 h-5 w-5 text-yellow-400" />
                <span class="text-gray-300">Direct API integration with Palermo booking platforms</span>
              </div>
